    "created_at": "2016-04-27T11:21:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-27T11:21:19Z",
    "body": "Currently we store a creation URL (a copy of Document's address) when we create a browsing context settings object. So I think I'll just add that the origin is a copy at creation time, as we already do elsewhere where we define origins.\n\nMy goal is to eventually refactor that section and put the origin requirements inline where documents are created. The problem is that the latter is rather messy at the moment. So much technical debt.\n",
